.TH NN-QUANT 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-quant \- analyze quantization
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn quant [options] <model>|compare <a> <b>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report quantized vs float tensors, Q/DQ nodes, and optional pairwise comparison.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-compare
Compare two models (nn quant compare).
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn quant model.tflite
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-sparsity(1), nn-compare(1)
